release scope, and display eligibility as separate axes.\n\n## Boundary\n\n- Artifact/schema/policy only: no screenshots, no crops, no runtime storage mutation, no production Supabase/storage/RAG/vector/model/OCR/VLM/scoring/Smart Mark mutation.\n- Freezes the V1 target as complete question-level MS source view; subpart crop and mark-point crop remain non-targets.\n- Keeps MS source view post-attempt/self-assessment only, with no automatic scoring or awarded-mark wording.\n- Keeps `document_only` as external fallback or unavailable; it is not in-app full-document reveal.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-reveal-boundary.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-product-display-posture.test.js` (52 tests passed)\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-reveal-boundary.mjs --write` (validator status `pass`)\n- Boundary safety grep over generated artifacts and builder returned no matches for forbidden true states or secrets.\n- `git diff --cached --check` (clean before commit)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (post-commit clean worktree; warnings only for branch naming and ahead-by-one before push)\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T15:33:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T15:46:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T15:46:30Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T15:46:30Z","merge_commit_sha":"614fbdf369d693a2beccf2bbc60359c32d34d9d8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1525/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1525/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/